read: baptist-perpetuity | Baptist Perpetuity

=== Close
--- Stand fast [title]
overline: Galatians 5:1
sub: “Stand fast therefore in the liberty wherewith Christ hath made us free, and be not entangled again with the yoke of bondage.”
point: Soul liberty | Every one of us shall give account of himself to God. [[Romans 14:12]]
point: Obey God rather than men | Even when the court says otherwise. [[Acts 5:29]]
point: Believers, baptized | A church of the saved, by their own profession. [[Acts 8:36-37]]
point: Liberty for all | The conscience cannot be forced, and the gospel does not need the sword. [[2 Corinthians 10:4]]
